    "body": "fix on issue/2303-linuxcnc-post · PR #2310 · pinned by linuxcnc_post (9 tests), conformance (linuxcnc goldens), script_linuxcnc, cycle_hop · merges at the next cut\n\n@sn3ro: the post is `LinuxCNC` with the machine `LinuxCNC 3-axis`. The default retract is `G53 G0 Z<safe_retract>` from the machine file. The generic machine file states no `safe_retract`, so state it for your machine, or set the post option Retract to G28, G30 or None. Rigid tapping (`G33.1`) needs `rigid_tapping: true` on the spindle. A sim run of the goldens in `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/linuxcnc/` will help when the PR is ready.",
